                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-d7c5c259-22c0-4f4e-be33-2faf26f1af74" type="punctum" xml:id="m-62b21964-dde9-4476-a270-ed11fe1478f2">
                    <nc xml:id="m-930e59f2-2063-4b6d-a565-9e7e9013582b" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-5a33618d-c3ac-4c1e-92aa-528c0df93359">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-5bffab67-7e33-42dc-a35f-b800bc0ce1ae" type="punctum" xml:id="m-bf9bb7fa-a09b-409b-ad28-3637b0d97b2f">
                    <nc xml:id="m-df899f35-36ce-4ece-b21c-f55a78c7c961" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-8489a0df-9ee6-49bb-b2a4-440ece377d80">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-a234b5ff-c582-43a2-addc-2c2c679166ca" type="clivis" xml:id="m-8092eee3-3998-4997-a8e2-a567bef891e0">
                    <nc xml:id="m-9e613afa-8efa-47a4-a04a-98350fb3bac5" pname="g" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-c5a5c005-5e5a-4ee0-b253-9fe190b08fe1" pname="f" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-e47a3d6f-4169-4651-ab80-1c2f60613287" facs="#m-5954682f-8e9c-426c-8062-f6dfb6d8e49d" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-0d0e84a6-d6c8-4b05-b07f-139e6ea3941b">
              <lg xml:id="m-fd70f0b1-ee34-4c50-9ba8-64917bd542b5">
                <l xml:id="m-c8d6bef1-b91f-47de-b537-a98f24ca39e8" facs="#m-2c638fe1-42fd-4634-9129-fd78f5bfacaf" label="text-like">The Epiphany of Our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-caf66048-0d6d-4e21-bd6d-eb818551109d" facs="#m-771d1e53-5263-4bd1-85a4-12cf656c7cd4" label="ambiguous">458</l><l xml:id="m-55c47b7c-cbcb-4490-a6b7-f1d05684c965" facs="#m-6256b140-da4a-453c-a425-4dcf251368b8" label="lyrics-like">áqua fácto víno</l><l xml:id="m-e5a47ecd-acaa-45a2-85c0-c2eeeb198496" facs="#m-411562e6-020c-4d1e-8a38-3bdc235408a7" label="lyrics-like">laetántur conví-vae, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-9c2f00ba-4f9b-41ea-a7ab-78ae61eaaeb9" facs="#m-51c9eeae-227f-4742-b781-56513790886d" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1e558579-fe07-4c45-bac7-523a0bba8825" facs="#m-a1e400ac-82d7-43b6-97b0-769abc94a283" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui hodiérna die. p. 459.</l><l xml:id="m-fb8c2af0-ede6-4df5-a972-a9935e738667" facs="#m-bf28c795-6032-446c-af03-fa0fb15a86f1" label="text-like">At Prime. The Hymn is sung in the tone indicated for Terce. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-d295a30c-7a31-4c7c-93dd-d37e6906a107" facs="#m-ce6a3dfa-26c6-46f1-9dfe-2d287d8b476a" label="lyrics-like">Ante luciferum génitus. D.463. In the Short Resp., the V. Qui apparuisti</l><l xml:id="m-f1209dfd-05dc-4d13-9f0c-d11aaf720ebe" facs="#m-90f4c9f5-487a-484f-8c7b-7e5103b41520" label="lyrics-like">hódie. is said, p. 229. This Y. is said throughout the Octave. Short Lesson</l><l xml:id="m-a9ad27f2-30c5-4770-a27d-b574e204795c" facs="#m-6d24d0f6-0945-42af-87a1-8b262c583ecf" label="lyrics-like">Omnes de Sába. p. 462.</l><l xml:id="m-c6215221-3621-4116-b9ee-6cf849f8f2db" facs="#m-ead6ab23-a8c0-4771-97ef-be0f2fa121c2" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-1e5a7cf5-14b7-464f-8b86-7b9cebc69c12" facs="#m-b5cb94c9-a63c-49e0-8375-ee61973997f3" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-b470a6b3-2967-41b2-95f0-797305e12ac1" facs="#m-ed1b42f5-a030-45cd-a398-06cb1cdd0701" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-6e45e0e3-c553-4eae-9036-c7aa7bca7172" facs="#m-120a542b-3dd1-4c70-b5f4-6083629fd41b" label="ambiguous">n</l><l xml:id="m-d873f505-7ecf-4e15-a241-f6d5575c6e7a" facs="#m-80f697ba-71c9-4b9f-9e95-b18a81169a5d" label="lyrics-like">Unc Sáncte nóbis Spí-ri-tus, Unum Pátri cum Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-045a1c86-eb68-4890-ad13-b417c9f2a4ef" facs="#m-e8669840-eea5-4871-99bb-5a2aad31f927" label="lyrics-like">li-o, Dignáre prómptus inge-ri, Nóstro re-fúsus péctori.</l><l xml:id="m-1b4cf393-538c-42f6-83b1-d211ef570f27" facs="#m-e3bf5e38-53cc-462c-8d6c-df81b280f2b0" label="lyrics-like">Praésta, Páter piissime,</l><l xml:id="m-037bd7dc-bd8d-4a1d-ae36-795bb4190a86" facs="#m-1648ca2d-d5c5-4ad7-ba65-50c90621f4dc" label="lyrics-like">Os, lingua, mens, sénsus, vigor,</l><l xml:id="m-3b982ab7-f058-4dc7-9f28-e8619f1b90bb" facs="#m-51cedb5a-ab74-4862-9c5a-ded132e5a0d4" label="lyrics-like">Confessiónem pérsonent:</l><l xml:id="m-d6f11d1d-de03-4210-af6e-f7333c4b9b05" facs="#m-c81d679a-d4d0-4e39-b1cb-d67e50bc27f5" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-b151b04b-b593-4471-a40a-e73087784ff5" facs="#m-bb2c2400-a1ff-47a7-97de-94dfc18b2529" label="lyrics-like">Flamméscat igne cáritas,</l><l xml:id="m-5a29f87f-6861-41a8-a12e-6340f3dde621" facs="#m-e3a7c116-efdc-4ea5-935d-49592d91666a" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spiritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-547856c7-5764-43b3-a476-5447c12b9107" facs="#m-2e851817-e39b-4672-a464-4477dc246cf8" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saéculum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-f4e53f9c-48f2-4ece-9b96-64a8e23f0baa" facs="#m-7e179f72-4e94-4029-965d-9b8bbe207e75" label="lyrics-like">Accéndat árdor próximos.</l><l xml:id="m-c01f15f8-9378-41f7-b594-decc6c08e01f" facs="#m-f6b70aea-61ac-4f9e-8b40-09019ce32ab2" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Vénit lúmen túum. p. 163. Chapter of Vespers: Surge. p. 464.</l><l xml:id="m-71ac7f9f-6a22-4f1a-b8eb-4bebe0489433" facs="#m-049a4488-1bd7-4d99-b8a0-fa54116eab3f" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-dd73457c-30a3-4061-94cb-10a46a57e19f" facs="#m-3f6b985b-5fc9-471b-8f53-0170cf50e243" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-c1a3bb68-cd2d-4c4f-895f-e2d5edd22748" facs="#m-8a1b75b2-0059-4e56-8556-5685fa340394" label="lyrics-like">Eges Thársis et ínsulae múnera ófferent :“Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-33d463b5-822f-44ee-97b6-56014aed9bed" facs="#m-bd739ecf-f411-41e7-9ade-efcd88111600" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia, alle lú-ia. V. Réges Arabum et Sába dóna addúcent.</l><l xml:id="m-5e42bee8-c2ab-462c-8037-485e3da3254e" facs="#m-b878c2cd-7b61-41fa-bc75-a30a98d46995" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-8c1c7324-f14c-4f6a-bf24-99ca901d29de" facs="#m-d8fe24e6-58f7-45a6-a468-a93276ebe76e" label="lyrics-like">V. Omnes de Sába vénient, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-ef889358-9878-45f2-a671-779230caafb7" facs="#m-f75891ad-2a43-4235-b54a-d9d9f5505811" label="lyrics-like">R. Aurum et thus deferéntes, allelúia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>